id: pm-gus5ft
title: "GH-862: pm-beads must map Beads close reasons into native resolution metadata"
description: "Closed Beads records can carry close rationale that is not mapped into pm resolution, expected_result, actual_result, and close_reason metadata. Import must preserve source meaning in native terminal fields without inventing evidence."
