acceptance_criteria: Known Beads close-reason variants map deterministically into native PM terminal metadata; absent source fields remain explicitly unavailable rather than fabricated; comments/events remain lossless; imported closed records satisfy resolution validation where the source provides sufficient evidence; package and installed-consumer acceptance pass
goal: project management = context management
objective: Retain terminal decision context across Beads migrations
value: Makes imported closed work reconstructable and compatible with strict PM validation
why_now: GitHub issue #862 identifies a live terminal-metadata parity gap
