resolution: Implemented
expected_result: "Beads terminal evidence maps deterministically to native resolution, close_reason, expected_result, and actual_result fields without inventing unavailable source facts."
actual_result: Explicit source terminal fields round-trip exactly; close_reason supplies resolution only when explicit resolution is absent; missing expected/actual evidence remains absent and is honestly reported by validation.
